<view class="page flow-page">
  <view class="page-heading"><view><view class="page-title">卖货记录</view><text>只读查看销售数量与收款</text></view><view class="tag">仅供查看</view></view>

  <view class="flow-hero sale-hero">
    <view class="hero-decoration"></view>
    <view class="hero-label">今日卖货</view>
    <view class="hero-number">{{todayQuantity}}<text> 件</text></view>
    <view class="hero-amount"><text>今日收款</text><view>{{todayAmountText}}</view></view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip-card"><view class="tip-icon">卖</view><view><view>卖货后自动减库存</view><text>库存不足时会提醒，不会把库存减成负数。</text></view></view>

  <view class="section-head"><view><view class="section-title">每次卖货明细</view><view class="section-subtitle">共 {{records.length}} 条记录</view></view></view>
  <view class="card record-list" wx:if="{{records.length}}">
    <view class="record-row" wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="record-badge">卖{{item.quantity}}</view>
      <view class="record-main"><view class="record-name">{{item.productName}}</view><view class="record-meta">{{item.specText}} · {{item.paymentMethod}}</view><view class="record-time">{{item.timeText}} · {{item.operator}}</view></view>
      <view class="record-money"><view>{{item.totalAmountText}}</view><text>{{item.unitPriceText}}/件</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:else class="empty-flow"><view class="empty-symbol">卖</view><view>还没有卖货记录</view><text>记录可在网页管理后台维护。</text></view>
</view>
